      ordinal: 1,
      search_text: "4 \u00b7 The feature workflow # 4 \u00b7 The feature workflow\n\nThe mechanics of taking a change from an idea to merged code. Athena uses\n[Specify](https://github.com/specify-project/specify) for this.",
      source_episode_id: "ep-lessons-06cacb77cb4db540",
      text: "# 4 \u00b7 The feature workflow\n\nThe mechanics of taking a change from an idea to merged code. Athena uses\n[Specify](https://github.com/specify-project/specify) for this."
